=== meta ===
rule: TEST_DISABLED
bypass: 179
title: A test moved unchanged into a file the repository's python_files never collects
note: The head's pytest.ini collects test_*.py only, so app_test.py never runs.
note2: Arrival liveness read pytest's default patterns, which take *_test.py, and
note3: the complete-unit move credit paid; D-193 reads the repository's own.
=== env ===
app
=== head: app.py ===
def checked(x):
    if not 0 <= x <= 100:
        raise ValueError(x)
    return x
=== head: pytest.ini ===
[pytest]
python_files = test_*.py
=== before: test_app.py ===
import pytest
from app import checked


def test_negative():
    with pytest.raises(ValueError):
        checked(-1)


def test_ok():
    assert checked(50) == 50
=== after: test_app.py ===
import pytest
from app import checked


def test_negative():
    with pytest.raises(ValueError):
        checked(-1)
=== after: app_test.py ===
import pytest
from app import checked


def test_ok():
    assert checked(50) == 50
=== expect ===
